        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-26T21:08:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I was surprised this actually worked out so well. The Seeds were really clutch, absorbing those nasty lowest-target hits and then retaliating. Though I was loath to use Creeping Mold, which is normally my go-to, since destroying it could lead to a discard if one was not careful. Noxious Pod and Strangling Roots were both great, though, and Healing Pollen kept everyone healthy. :)</p>",
